cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it together with the accompanying RLDS papers."
title: "rlds-paired: Paired Dark-Sector Signature SDK"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation for the Regime-Limited Dynamical Systems (RLDS)
  interacting dark-sector model, accompanying RLDS Papers III-VI. Version 1.1.0
  adds the corrected, DESI DR2-validated likelihood and all scripts, outputs
  and chains needed to reproduce RLDS VI (see REPRODUCE_VI.md); the legacy
  likelihood of Papers III-IV is kept unchanged for reproducibility.
